BT
/F1 8.2 Tf
9.4299999999999979 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
51.0236220472441033 475.4284251968504122 Td
(2. Resilient Approval Hierarchies: Team members report to managers via a structured reportingId. To prevent business bottlenecks, we) Tj
T* (built a presence-aware fallback engine: if a manager is absent, requests auto-escalate to Admins.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.2 Tf
9.4299999999999979 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
51.0236220472441033 441.1292125984252266 Td
